  make -j2 all
  result: success

Run:
  timeout 12s qemu-system-x86_64 -M q35 -m 512M -cdrom build/npkernel.iso -serial file:/tmp/npk-phase5-pci-mouse-qemu.log -display none -no-reboot -no-shutdown
  expected timeout status: 124 (kernel idles)

Observed:
  [INFO] mouse: PS/2 three-byte pointer events enabled
  [INFO] pci: enumerated devices
  [INFO] keyboard: PS/2 set-1; Turkish Q layout enabled
